Powerhouse Dynamics / Middleby","location":"U.S. (remotely)","from":"2025-12-01","until":"2040-12-18","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Operating as a core integrations engineer for a B2B enterprise "},{"type":"text","text":"IoT ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"platform managing automated commercial kitchen appliances. Tasked with "},{"type":"text","text":"reverse-engineering","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","text":"scaling","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"text","text":"maintaining ","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":"a massive, custom PHP codebase to successfully "},{"type":"text","text":"onboard new enterprise clients","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" and their proprietary hardware."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key Achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Guaranteed flawless"},{"type":"text","text":" bi-directional","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" communication, from parsing incoming telemetry to safely executing over-the-air "},{"type":"text","text":"(OTA) firmware updates","bold":true}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Navigated and integrated features into a "},{"type":"text","text":"highly complex","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","text":"framework-less","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" PHP environment containing "},{"type":"text","text":"16,000+ line files","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Actively monitored logs, "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked performance metrics","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", and conducted rigorous "},{"type":"text","text":"impact analyses","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to ensure enterprise-grade stability during new device integrations."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dynamically updated schemas across a "},{"type":"text","text":"multi-database ecosystem","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to expand complex data architectures and catalog intricate"},{"type":"text","text":" IoT device metadata","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":null,"color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":6,"component_id":"cv, work experience, gl","title":"Fullstack Integration Specialist","orientation":"Backend oriented","company":"GlobalLogic","client":"Verizon","location":"U.S.","from":"2023-10-13","until":"2025-12-01","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Operated as an "},{"type":"text","text":"Acting Tech Lead","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and primary technical "},{"type":"text","text":"bridge","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" for an enterprise-scale API Marketplace built for "},{"type":"text","text":"Verizon","bold":true,"underline":true},{"type":"text","text":", one of the largest telecommunications companies in the U.S. Thriving in a highly "},{"type":"text","text":"fast-paced environment","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" I guided a massive cross-functional team while navigating a complex monorepo architecture utilizing Next.js, TypeScript, and a dual-backend system designed to separate heavy data processing from secondary documentation tasks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Spearheaded ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"the end-to-end "},{"type":"text","text":"creation ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"of a new Single Sign-On "},{"type":"text","text":"(SSO) solution","bold":true},{