e enterprise-grade stability during new device integrations."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dynamically updated schemas across a "},{"type":"text","text":"multi-database ecosystem","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to expand complex data architectures and catalog intricate"},{"type":"text","text":" IoT device metadata","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":null,"color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":6,"component_id":"cv, work experience, gl","title":"Fullstack Integration Specialist","orientation":"Backend oriented","company":"GlobalLogic","client":"Verizon","location":"U.S.","from":"2023-10-13","until":"2025-12-01","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Operated as an "},{"type":"text","text":"Acting Tech Lead","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and primary technical "},{"type":"text","text":"bridge","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" for an enterprise-scale API Marketplace built for "},{"type":"text","text":"Verizon","bold":true,"underline":true},{"type":"text","text":", one of the largest telecommunications companies in the U.S. Thriving in a highly "},{"type":"text","text":"fast-paced environment","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" I guided a massive cross-functional team while navigating a complex monorepo architecture utilizing Next.js, TypeScript, and a dual-backend system designed to separate heavy data processing from secondary documentation tasks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Spearheaded ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"the end-to-end "},{"type":"text","text":"creation ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"of a new Single Sign-On "},{"type":"text","text":"(SSO) solution","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" across the entire platform, replacing a legacy system that was unsafe and difficult to integrate. The new architecture enabled seamless authentication across 5 distinct frontend apps (2 producer, 3 consumer) and the dual-backend system."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Stepped up to"},{"type":"text","text":" lead coordination","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" across a massive team of Frontend, Backend, UX/UI, and DevOps engineers, ensuring rapid, "},{"type":"text","text":"high-quality","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" feature delivery aligned with "},{"type":"text","text":"Verizon's strict","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deadlines","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":""}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":"left","color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":5,"component_id":"cv, work experience section, finalis","title":"Frontend Architectural Consultant","orientation":null,"company":"Finalis","client":null,"location":"U.S.","from":"2023-12-01","until":"2024-04-19","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Acted as an external "},{"type":"text","text":"technical consultant","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" for an established US-based "},{"type":"text","text":"fintech","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", coordinating the Frontend team through a major infrastructure overhaul and guided the transition of a critical "},{"type":"text","text":"consumer-facing application","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" during the large scale migration from an REST API infrastructure into a modern "},{"type":"text","text":"Next.js + GraphQL environment","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","