ullstack Developer at an Argentine software factory, spearheading the "},{"type":"text","text":"technical delivery","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" of a "},{"type":"text","text":"highly secure","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" government platform. Engineered three robust PHP/Laravel applications designed to digitize "},{"type":"text","text":"public infrastructure","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and building paperwork for local citizens."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Led direct client consultations","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to gather complex municipal requirements, translating acceptance criteria into actionable technical architectures, cross-team sprint plans, and time estimations."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Architected a strict "},{"type":"text","text":"security-first environment","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" with robust protections against SQL injections, endpoint scraping, and unauthorized access, effectively "},{"type":"text","text":"securing communications","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" between the "},{"type":"text","text":"Frontend and Backend","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" via Laravel's built-in REST API methods.  "}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Engineered "},{"type":"text","text":"intelligent file-handling pipelines","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" that "},{"type":"text","text":"actively scanned","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" user uploads for malicious code before compressing them to "},{"type":"text","text":"maximize efficiency","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and optimize storage on the municipality's "},{"type":"text","text":"custom bare-metal servers.","u